{'symbol': 'SO', 'date': '2022-12-02 11:30:00', 'title': "MISSISSIPPI POWER, FORREST COUNTY AGRICULTURAL HIGH SCHOOL CELEBRATE STATE'S FIRST ELECTRIC SCHOOL BUS IN OPERATION", 'text': 'GULFPORT, MISS. , DEC. 2, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- REPRESENTATIVES FROM MISSISSIPPI POWER AND FORREST COUNTY AGRICULTURAL HIGH SCHOOL HELD A RIBBON-CUTTING CEREMONY AS THE FIRST ELECTRIC SCHOOL BUS IN THE STATE OF MISSISSIPPI BEGAN OPERATING TODAY IN BROOKLYN.'}